<html style="overflow-y: hidden;">
<head>
    <title>Case Follow Up</title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</p>

<p>Your medical case ({{{Case.CaseNumber}}}) requires a follow-up. Please check your Kizuna Care dashboard for more details.</p>

<table cellpadding="8" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="background:#F5F9FC; border:1px solid #E0E0E0; font-weight:bold;">Case Subject</td>
    <td style="border:1px solid #E0E0E0;">{{{Case.Subject}}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background:#F5F9FC; border:1px solid #E0E0E0; font-weight:bold;">Status</td>
    <td style="border:1px solid #E0E0E0;">{{{Case.Status}}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact your village health worker.</p>

<p>Kizuna Care<br/>
Healthcare for rural India</p>
</body>
</html>
